{"4825460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Juicy Fugitives", "steam_appid": 4825460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt down the most wanted fruits across five kingdoms, solo or in 3 player online co-op!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/45ed220163b1c37c80ad39ae9ac6e1df.poster.avif?t=1783392188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/45ed220163b1c37c80ad39ae9ac6e1df.webm?t=1783392188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/45ed220163b1c37c80ad39ae9ac6e1df.mp4?t=1783392188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peace in the five kingdoms is shattered when a mysterious fire destroys a newly arrived pirate ship. The prime suspects? The local fruits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furious, Captain Hook Shark and his crew issue a bounty across the land: WANTED: FRUITS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the pirate crew and storm all five kingdoms to bring those juicy fugitives to justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/170d6ffc517ae78ec701705dc79ca2a2.poster.avif?t=1783392188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/170d6ffc517ae78ec701705dc79ca2a2.webm?t=1783392188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/170d6ffc517ae78ec701705dc79ca2a2.mp4?t=1783392188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Online co-op for up to 3 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 10 boss fights with cinematic introductions: 5 mini bosses and 5 kingdom bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Squash, flatten, and launch 20 unique enemy types with absurd cartoon weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play as Shark, Dragon, and Rooster, each with their own weapons and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 5 colorful kingdoms to explore and fight through</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Slapstick comedy inspired by classic cartoons, with expressive characters and hilarious reactions</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt down the most wanted fruits across five kingdoms, solo or in 3 player online co-op!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/45ed220163b1c37c80ad39ae9ac6e1df.poster.avif?t=1783392188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/45ed220163b1c37c80ad39ae9ac6e1df.webm?t=1783392188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/45ed220163b1c37c80ad39ae9ac6e1df.mp4?t=1783392188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peace in the five kingdoms is shattered when a mysterious fire destroys a newly arrived pirate ship. The prime suspects? The local fruits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furious, Captain Hook Shark and his crew issue a bounty across the land: WANTED: FRUITS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the pirate crew and storm all five kingdoms to bring those juicy fugitives to justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/170d6ffc517ae78ec701705dc79ca2a2.poster.avif?t=1783392188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/170d6ffc517ae78ec701705dc79ca2a2.webm?t=1783392188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/extras/170d6ffc517ae78ec701705dc79ca2a2.mp4?t=1783392188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Online co-op for up to 3 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 10 boss fights with cinematic introductions: 5 mini bosses and 5 kingdom bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Squash, flatten, and launch 20 unique enemy types with absurd cartoon weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play as Shark, Dragon, and Rooster, each with their own weapons and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 5 colorful kingdoms to explore and fight through</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Slapstick comedy inspired by classic cartoons, with expressive characters and hilarious reactions</p>", "short_description": "Hunt down the most wanted fruits in this cartoon third-person shooter. Play as a pirate crew framed by a mysterious fire, blast through waves of enemies across 5 kingdoms, and survive slapstick boss fights, solo or in 3 player online co-op.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/364c1481cb1e825cb3bca52161ed4bacb90f2f46/header.jpg?t=1783392188", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/ceea3750d5baecf6bd324f1ada6b3fbd48e4763c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783392188", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825460/ceea3750d5baecf6bd324f1ada6b3fbd48e4763c/capsule_184